<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<chapter xml:id="ch-functions" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Functions and Graphing</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      A function is a rule that assigns exactly one output to each input.
      Representing functions graphically connects algebra to geometry and opens up a powerful way to analyse real-world relationships.
    </p>
  </introduction>

